# API configuration for Nepal TechGuard
#
# DEFAULT (recommended for local dev): Leave both unset.
# - Run "npm run dev" from project root → starts backend on 8000 + frontend on 5173
# - Vite proxy forwards /api → localhost:8000 (no CORS issues)
#
# XAMPP / custom backend: Set full API URL when backend runs elsewhere:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost/Nepal-TechGuard/api
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
